# Default SEO skills

This repo vendors six SEO skills as **default workflow**. They are not optional.

Before any site, page, content, search, metadata, or app-store work, read the matching skill and follow it:

- Vague SEO, technical SEO, rankings, indexing, meta tags, CWV → `.agents/skills/seo-audit/SKILL.md`
- AI search / AEO / GEO / LLM citations / `llms.txt` → `.agents/skills/ai-seo/SKILL.md`
- Pages at scale from templates or data → `.agents/skills/programmatic-seo/SKILL.md`
- JSON-LD / schema.org / rich results → `.agents/skills/schema/SKILL.md`
- App Store or Google Play listing → `.agents/skills/aso/SKILL.md`
- IA, nav, URL structure, internal linking → `.agents/skills/site-architecture/SKILL.md`

Copies also live under `.cursor/skills/`. Prefer `.agents/skills/` as the source of truth.

If the request is only “help with SEO,” start with `seo-audit`.
